hoe (26.3.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the Quick Load window is opened when Instant Preview is disabled, and then Instant Preview is enabled, then the first new resource that the user selects will not be previewed in the editor. Only the second (and onwards) resources will be reflected in the editor.\n\n(If Instant Preview is already enabled when the Quick Load window is opened, then clicking a new resource will immediately update the editor preview, as expected.) \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea720301-1297-436a-994a-60f13782713e\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the Quick Load window.\n- If Instant Preview is enabled, disable it.\n- Close the Quick Load window.\n- Reopen the Quick Load window. Take note of the resource currently being displayed in the editor window (such as the texture for a Sprite2D).\n- Enable Instant Preview.\n- Select a different resource. Note that the previewed resource in the editor does not change.\n- Select another different resource. Note that this time, the previewed resource in the editor does change.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A\n\nI can put one together if necessary, but in general this should work for a new Godot project with a Sprite2D and at least three texture files.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116650/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116650/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}